      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez, Odiseo y doce de sus hombres quedaron atrapados en la cueva de un gigante.",
          "en": "Last time, Odysseus and twelve of his men were trapped in a giant's cave."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Cíclope Polifemo, hijo de Poseidón, había cerrado la entrada con una piedra enorme.",
          "en": "The Cyclops Polyphemus, a son of Poseidon, had closed the door with a huge stone."
        },
        {
          "es": "Odiseo le había pedido que respetara a los dioses. Pero el gigante solo se rió.",
          "en": "Odysseus had asked him to respect the gods. But the giant only laughed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces agarró a dos de los hombres, y se los comió de cena.",
          "en": "Then he grabbed two of the men, and ate them for his supper."
        },
        {
          "es": "Después se tomó un balde de leche, y se durmió entre sus ovejas.",
          "en": "After that, he drank a bucket of milk, and fell asleep among his sheep."
        }
      ],
